### 练习与通知模块 API 测试

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000
@studentToken = {{loginStudent.response.body.token}}
@teacherToken = {{loginTeacher.response.body.token}}
@courseId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-00000001001c

### TC-PRACTICE-001 查看练习标签
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/practice/tags
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-PRACTICE-002 智能组卷创建练习会话
POST {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/practice/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mode": "SMART",
  "count": 5
}

### TC-PRACTICE-003 教师查看题库
GET {{baseUrl}}/courses/{{courseId}}/practice/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{teacherToken}}

### TC-NOTIFY-001 未读通知数
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### TC-NOTIFY-002 通知列表
GET {{baseUrl}}/notifications
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
